# in.gas — week09 · 단분자(기상) 에너지: Method A = 벌크 좌표 그대로 run 0 · Method B = 큰 상자 NVT 평균
units          real
atom_style     full
boundary       p p p
pair_style     lj/cut/coul/cut 12.0
bond_style     harmonic
angle_style    harmonic
dihedral_style fourier
special_bonds  amber
read_data      ${data}
pair_modify    mix arithmetic tail no
neighbor       2.0 bin
thermo_style   custom step temp pe ebond eangle edihed evdwl ecoul
thermo         ${thermo}
timestep       1.0
